  chooseText: Selected the authorization beacon. If that buried station is still
    alive, we need a valid ship signature before it decides we are intruders.
  completedText: Authorization beacon recovered. I can now authenticate locally.
    The station rejected our distress signal before, but it may recognize us now.
  nextDayText: "Mission tip: start the walk, and motivation shows up on the way.
    Let\u2019s go."
